    "hp_faq": {
      "type": "hp-faq",
      "blocks": {
        "q1": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What is a DTF transfer?",
            "answer": "<p>DTF stands for Direct-to-Film, a printing method where your design is printed onto a special film and then heat pressed onto a garment. DTF transfers work on a wide range of fabrics—including cotton, polyester, blends, and more—and can be applied in about 12-15 seconds with a heat press.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q2": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What is the minimum I can order?",
            "answer": "<p>No Minimums! Whether you need 1 or 100,000 we can do it!</p>"
          }
        },
        "q3": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What kind of press do I need?",
            "answer": "<p>You can use the iron you have lying around your house or an industrial level heat press or anything in between. Learn more on our <a href=\"https://ninjatransfers.com/pages/application-instructions-for-dtf-transfers-heat-sources\" title=\"Application Instructions for DTF Transfers | Heat Sources\">How to Press</a> page.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q4": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What sizes are available?",
            "answer": "<p>Any size you would like! With gang sheets 22 inches wide and as tall as you want as well!</p>"
          }
        },
        "q5": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How do transfers hold up in the wash?",
            "answer": "<p>Ninja Transfers have been rigorously tested and verified by third party to ensure long-lasting durability. After undergoing 100 machine wash cycles (80°F, normal cycle, line dry) on a 100% cotton shirt, the transfers were evaluated for color retention, peeling, cracking, and overall integrity. The results were overwhelmingly positive, with a \"Satisfactory\" grade across all criteria, including negligible hand-feel change and no significant signs of delamination or print detachment.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q6": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How quickly can I get my order?",
            "answer": "<p>Expedited orders ship within 24 -48 hours.</p>"
          }
        },
        "qa_QRtYXy": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What file format should my artwork be?",
            "answer": "<p>Vector art is always preferred, raster art should be at least 300 dpi. Preferred file types: .AI, .PDF Accepted files types: .JPG, .PNG</p>"
          }
        },
        "qa_JEYLcC": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What is your refund policy?",
            "answer": "<p>We stand behind our work so If you have any issues with your transfers at all <a href=\"https://ninjatransfers.com/pages/contact\" title=\"Contact Us | Ninja Transfers\">Contact Us </a>and we'll be sure to make sure we solve whatever issue you might have.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
